  "Set the rectangle size to any single metric or blend your own composite with the weight sliders; recolour by domain, package, kind, stereotype, heat maps or Lua exposure; regroup the whole tree by package, domain, stereotype or kind; change the tiling algorithm, padding, depth limit and small-node culling. Settings persist in localStorage and the current view is encoded in the URL — use the Permalink button to share an exact configuration.": "Size rectangles by code or another metric; colour by source language, directory, declaration kind or a heat map. Zoom through directories and files, filter languages, and enable members for detail. Settings persist locally and can be shared with a permalink.",
